{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>The mishkan, ten panels.</b> First they made the ten panels of the tent, and afterward the structure, to put in it what covers over everything; and afterward all the sacred furnishings — the covering first, and afterward the partitions around the courtyard of the house." "<b>Cheruvim, the work of a weaver.</b> Regarding the ten panels that were visible from inside the mishkan's interior, it is written כרובים מעשה חושב תעשה אותם. But the eleven panels that were not visible above, because of the covering of rams' skins, nor below, because of the ten panels — they did not make figures on them."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:04.638689717Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}